/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (Smart Donation Connect is an AI-enabled platform that connects donors with verified people and organizations in need. It supports donations such as surplus food, clothes, electronic items, and money. The system uses AI/ML-based food-demand prediction to identify potential surplus food and a smart matching system to connect donors and receivers based on location, requirements, quantity, and urgency. The platform also provides notifications and donation tracking. The main aim is to reduce resource wastage and make the donation process more efficient, transparent, and accessible.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
